  "description": "Deprecated: use Esatto.Umbraco.Backoffice.TreeDragAndDrop. Native HTML5 drag-and-drop and keyboard reordering for the Umbraco 17/18 backoffice Content tree. Three-zone (above / into / below) drop targets, optimistic same-parent reorder, full cross-parent move, a move-in-progress spinner, and WCAG-compliant keyboard \"grab & place\". Pure App_Plugins package — no C# code.",
